# Android Spotlight Coachmark Overlay View

## Context

A custom Android `View` draws a coachmark overlay on top of an existing screen. The overlay dims the whole view, cuts a transparent spotlight hole around one active target, and draws a tooltip bubble with an arrow pointing to that target.

The task is visually simple, but the geometry is hard: the target may be near an edge, partly offscreen, in RTL layout, or too close to fit the tooltip normally.

## Task

Implement `SpotlightOverlayView`.

